6,1,1,talk,Mio,,I agree with Ryuji! I want to know who's actually using the place and doing the work. I'll check a fortnight's watch on kitchen use and absences on the wall calendar.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I think we should understand why our current communication is failing. I will look into the rows recorded in the house chat and the note left by the previous tenants.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
