64,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree with everyone. I don't want to worry about the cleaning standards or the bathroom anymore. Option C feels like the safest and most stable choice for me. I vote for Option C!,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
