67,3,2,talk,Victoria,,It is a relief that we have found a path that prioritizes our harmony. I am glad we are choosing the option that minimizes the risk of future conflict. My vote is for Option C.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Rin,,I'm so happy we're all on the same page! Let's just make sure we have a super clear way to pay the bill every month. I vote Option C!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,I'm just glad we can all agree. It makes me feel much more relaxed knowing we have a professional plan. I vote for Option C too.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,"The decision is unanimous. We have weighed the time commitment, the risk of interpersonal conflict, and the inconsistency of standards. Option C is the only logical conclusion.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
