73,3,3,talk,Victoria,,"I agree. By removing the burden of policing each other, we protect our friendship. I am satisfied with this outcome. My final vote is for Option C.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Rin,,I'm so excited! We're finally getting this sorted! Let's just promise to be super careful with the money so nobody gets grumpy. I vote Option C!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
